# instances.local — one Symphony instance per line, read by `make init-all`.
#
# Format:  <instance-name>  <args forwarded verbatim to `symphony init`>
#   - First whitespace-delimited token = instance name (A-Za-z0-9_.-).
#   - Everything after it = ARGS (same flags as `make init ARGS="..."`).
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#
# This file is the committed template. Copy it (the copy is gitignored):
#   cp instances.local.example instances.local
#
# `make init-all` skips instances that already exist; FORCE=1 regenerates all.

# `--gate-command` bakes the repo's full local gate into the worker rules;
# `--worker-notes-file` (or inline `--worker-notes '...'`) adds repo/host-specific
# worker rules. Keep note files next to this manifest (instances.local.d/ is
# gitignored too).
symphony --linear-project https://linear.app/identione/project/symphony-implementation-2e32f5d86d8c --repo-url https://github.com/Identione/symphony.git --agent claude --port 3454 --gate-command 'cd elixir && make all'
#entry --linear-project <slug> --repo-url https://github.com/Identione/entry-product-spec.git --agent claude --port 3455 --gate-command './scripts/verify-changed.sh --skip-missing' --worker-notes-file instances.local.d/entry-worker-notes.md
